Stellantis would owe the federal government $831 million if a sale of the Brampton Ontario

00:02:18.506 --> 00:02:23.466
plant proceeds. A source told CBC. Industry Minister Melanie Jolie said the

00:02:23.466 --> 00:02:27.226
