00:02:41.466 --> 00:02:46.086
news has it is keep the plant open or face that federal suit. And Ford's words

00:02:46.086 --> 00:02:51.818
describe the meeting, not a signed deal. President Donald Trump signed an executive order on Friday,

00:02:52.278 --> 00:02:56.198
telling every federal contractor to notify the White House before answering Congress.

00:02:56.758 --> 00:03:02.818
The order is executive order 14438, signed on the 20th of November, and it says anything the White

00:03:02.818 --> 00:03:08.558
House considers protected by executive privilege is not to be shared without its say-so. Contractors

00:03:08.558 --> 00:03:13.218
must notify first, telling the White House and their contracting agencies about relevant requests

00:03:13.218 --> 00:03:17.398
from Congress, and they must follow with holding instructions for communications deemed

00:03:17.398 --> 00:03:19.098
protected by executive privilege.

00:03:19.578 --> 00:03:24.538
The order sets no uncoordinated disclosures as United States policy, and the same rules

00:03:24.538 --> 00:03:26.778
cover subcontractors on federal contracts.

00:03:27.358 --> 00:03:32.198
The duty is notice before an answer, not a ban on Congress asking, and the withholding

00:03:32.198 --> 00:03:35.738
rule, as reported, covers only what the White House treats as privileged.

00:03:36.258 --> 00:03:40.478
The White House said the order went out Friday, and explainer of the term's notes that the

00:03:40.478 --> 00:03:45.338
office of management and budget will issue guidance on how it works in practice. Non-compliance

00:03:45.338 --> 00:03:50.638
could mean termination of the contract, debarment or suspension. Implementation stays subject

00:03:50.638 --> 00:03:55.178
to applicable law and available appropriations, which the account calls the order's own

00:03:55.178 --> 00:03:59.978
acknowledgement that it cannot override statutes or the Constitution. The order sits on the

00:03:59.978 --> 00:04:04.798
line between Congress and the presidency, because Congress's power to investigate the executive

00:04:04.798 --> 00:04:09.258
depends on information from the people who do the government's work, and a large share of

00:04:09.258 --> 00:04:10.718
that work is done by contractors.

00:04:11.298 --> 00:04:13.278
What the order does not spell out in the material

00:04:13.278 --> 00:04:16.178
published so far is who decides and how quickly,

00:04:16.558 --> 00:04:18.198
whether a given document is protected,

00:04:18.638 --> 00:04:20.918
and that is where the account says the fights will happen.

